    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Jeremy Murphy & Associates are delighted to present to the market No. 48 Greenwood Estate, Togher, Cork.\r\n\r\nThis well-presented and spacious three-bedroom semi-detached home offers a range of versatile living spaces throughout and benefits from a convenient side garage. \r\n\r\nIdeally located, the property is just approximately two minutes from the South Link Road network, providing excellent connectivity to Cork City and surrounding areas. It is also within walking distance of a host of local amenities, including shops, bars and restaurants, supermarkets, sports clubs, and primary schools, making it an ideal choice for families and commuters alike.\r\n\r\nViewing is Highly Advised to Fully Appreciate!\r\n\r\nGround floor accommodation consists of Porch, Entrance Hallway, Living Room, Lounge, Kitchen, Dining Room, Downstairs Bathroom and Garage. On the first floor there are Three Bedrooms and a Family Bathroom. There is also a Attic Room on the second floor."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "FRONT OF PROPERTY\r\nTo the front of the property there is off street parking.\r\n\r\nPORCH          \t                          1.90m x 0.60m\r\nThe porch comprises of sliding doors, one wall light and beautiful timber flooring.\r\n\r\nENTRANCE HALLWAY          \t  4.50m x 2.20m\r\nThe entrance hallway comprises of carpet flooring, one centre light, one radiator and space for storage under the stairs.\r\n\r\nLIVING ROOM \t\t              3.60m x 4.30m\r\nThis bright and spacious living room has timber flooring, one centre light, one radiator and one window overlooking the front of the property. The living room also has a feature open fireplace with a stunning surround.\r\n\r\nLOUNGE                                            3.90m x 3.50m\r\nThe lounge is located to the rear of the property and features timber flooring, one window overlooking the rear, one radiator and one centre light. \r\n\r\nDINING ROOM                                 2.80m x 4.40m\r\nThe dining area comprises of timber flooring, one centre light and one radiator. The dining room can comfortably facilitate a dining table and six to eight chairs. French doors give access to the kitchen.\r\n\r\nKITCHEN\t \t                          2.10m x 3.70m\r\nThis kitchen benefits from tiled, one window overlooking the rear and one to the side, one radiator and one centre light. The kitchen also benefits from a range of fitted kitchen units with a contrasting countertop. The kitchen incorporates a stainless-steel sink with a draining board, and a four-ring hob and with an extractor fan located above. \r\n\r\nGUEST WC \t\t\t              2.40m x 1.80m\r\nThere is tiled flooring, one electric shower, one wash hand basin and a wc. The guest wc also incorporates one window with frosted glass overlooking the rear, one centre light and one heated towel rail.\r\n\r\nSTAIRS & LANDING                   \r\nThe stairs and landing are fully carpeted. Via the landing there is one centre light and one window overlooking the side of the property.\r\n\r\nBEDROOM 1                                   3.50 m x 3.50m\r\nThis double bedroom features carpet fitted flooring, one centre light, one radiator and one window overlooking the rear. There are also built-in wardrobe units.\r\n\r\nBEDROOM 2 \t\t\t3.40m x 2.90m\r\nThis double bedroom features carpet fitted flooring, one centre light, one radiator and one window overlooking the front of the property. There are also built-in wardrobe units.\r\n\r\nBEDROOM 3\t\t\t2.40m x 2.40m\r\nThis bedroom features carpet fitted flooring, one centre light, one radiator and one window overlooking the front. There are also built-in wardrobe units.\r\n\r\nMAIN BATHROOM \t\t2.20m x 2.20m\r\nThree-piece bathroom suite incorporating a shower, wash hand basin and wc. The main bathroom has tiled flooring, one window with frosted glass paneling overlooking the rear, one centre light and one radiator. \r\n\r\nATTIC\r\nThis home also comprises of another floor with space for storage. \r\n\r\nGARAGE                                           9.60m x 2.80m\r\nThe spacious garage offers excellent storage potential and is equally well suited for use as a workshop or home gym. Subject to the necessary planning permission, it also presents an excellent opportunity for conversion into additional living accommodation.\r\n\r\nREAR OF PROPERTY\r\nThe generous south-facing rear garden is beautifully maintained and offers an excellent outdoor space to enjoy throughout the year. It features a spacious patio area with ample room for outdoor furniture, while the remainder is laid to lawn, providing plenty of space for children to play or for gardening enthusiasts. This attractive garden is the perfect setting for relaxing or entertaining family and friends during the summer months."
      },
      {
